# Tool and agent artefacts. The rule is category-based, not filename-based:
# if a tool wrote it for us rather than for visitors, it does not belong in a
# public repo. Adding a new tool? Add its files here first, before you run it.
# See "What must never be committed" for more info.

# Agent instruction and memory files
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
AGENT.md
GEMINI.md
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.aiderrules
.clinerules
copilot-instructions.md
.github/copilot-instructions.md

